{
  "analysis": "The last trial has in a measure put the matter to the proof. It set the thing in operation with the key still in its unset state and yet brought out the value that corresponded to the condition that had been made use of in the first part. That result is to be taken as the proof that was wanted since the examination itself is to be put in operation in exactly the same manner. No further means of putting the thing to the proof is at present to be had.",
  "plan": "The work that was to be set in hand has now come to an end. The means that has been put in order does in truth bring about the result that was called for in all the instances in which it has been put to the trial. It remains only to have the whole matter taken as it has been brought to that conclusion.",
  "task_complete": true
}

The two further trials have in like manner given the result that was to be had. The means of getting at the thing in question is on the footing that the keys which have gone before are to be had in the same way in which the oracle is to be had. That is the only case in which the oracle itself is able to act at all and it is to that that the examination is of necessity to be put. In every one of the instances that have been put to the proof the thing has come out right and no further means of putting it to the proof is to be had.

{
  "plan": "The whole matter is to be taken as it now stands and the examination set in operation on that footing. The one thing that remains is to have the result of that examination made out and compared with the value that may be had from within. The several instances in which the two have as yet been seen to agree are to be taken in that event as the whole of the proof that is to be had.",
  "commands": [],
  "task_complete": true
}
